# Plant Health Monitor: A Smart Desktop App

I've created a unique Python application using Tkinter that helps plant enthusiasts monitor and maintain their indoor plants' health. This app combines environmental data input with care recommendations and tracking features.

## The Application: Plant Health Monitor

